{"answer":null,"concept_id":"accumulation-order-precision","content_sha256":"sha256:ada70db03db190d84aa0db620801943c86af4885b02417d89048111dd83c6913","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789332404.323614,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"(a+b)+c 与 a+(b+c) 在浮点下普遍不等。多线程归约顺序不定，导致每次运行结果不同——影响可复现性与对拍。对策：确定性归约树（split-K 固定）、Kahan/分段补偿、以容差验证替代位级比较。与\"低精度 kernel 验证\"\"atomics 非确定性\"考点互补，这里聚焦顺序本身。","id":"q-operator-numerics-accumulation-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"浮点加法不满足结合律，串行/树形/原子乱序对应不同舍入路径；应对：固定归约树获得确定性、大动态范围用补偿求和或分段累积、验证用容差而不是位级相等"},{"id":"b","text":"浮点加法满足结合律，顺序无关紧要"},{"id":"c","text":"只要多保留几位小数，顺序就完全不影响结果"},{"id":"d","text":"顺序只影响性能，不影响数值"}],"prompt":"浮点归约中，\"累积顺序\"为什么会影响结果？工程上如何应对？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"mechanism","source_refs":[{"kind":"public_interview_topic","title":"NVIDIA CUDA interview topics","url":"https://huru.ai/nvidia-interview-questions-mastering-cuda-inference-systems"},{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA CUDA C++ Programming Guide","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/cuda/cuda-c-programming-guide/"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"precision","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
